@startuml
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber

participant "Server" as S
participant "Broadcast (All Clients)" as B

note over S, B: notifyTurnOrderEstablished was already sent in NewRoundState\nbefore this transition (see diagram H).

== NewEraState Entry ==

note over S: onEntry(): notifyPhaseObservers(NEW_ERA) before onEntryActions()
loop for each active BuildingEffect (PhaseObserver)
    S ->> B: notifyPlayerResourceChanged(nickname, resource, newValue, delta)
end

S ->> B: notifyPhaseChanged(phase: NEW_ERA, currentPlayer: null, resolutionOrder: null)

== New Era Preparation ==

note over S: executeNewEraPreparation() -> updateRowsForNewEra()
S ->> B: notifyEraChanged(newEra: Era, newUpperRowBuildings: List<String>, newLowerRowBuildings: List<String>, discardedBuildings: List<String>)

== Transition to TotemPlacementState ==

note over S: transitionTo(TotemPlacementState)\nnotifyPhaseObservers(TOTEM_PLACEMENT)
loop for each active BuildingEffect (PhaseObserver)
    S ->> B: notifyPlayerResourceChanged(nickname, resource, newValue, delta)
end
S ->> B: notifyPhaseChanged(phase: TOTEM_PLACEMENT, currentPlayer: String, resolutionOrder: null)

note right S: See TotemPlacementState diagram (C)
@enduml